{"id":"df6e75b9887b02cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-slope.md","title":"Slope Stability of Vector Bundles","display":"df-slope — Slope Stability of Vector Bundles","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-slope","aliases":["58-df-slope","Slope"],"display":"df-slope — Slope Stability of Vector Bundles","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-projective-curve.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-chern-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-slope"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-slope</span><span>Slope</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-slope — Slope Stability of Vector Bundles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71c5426cce937ee1\" href=\"?note=71c5426cce937ee1\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-projective-curve.md\">../batch15/58-df-projective-curve.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"13f5e356bc6a9655\" href=\"?note=13f5e356bc6a9655\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md\">../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ee356c2b76fa7ec\" href=\"?note=8ee356c2b76fa7ec\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-chern-class.md\">../batch03/58-df-chern-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-slope-—-Slope\">df-slope — Slope</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (complex projective curve), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X=\\operatorname{Zar}(X)\">\\(\\tau_X=\\operatorname{Zar}(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_X\">\\(\\mathcal O_X\\)</span> (its structure sheaf)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (a nonzero locally free coherent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_X\">\\(\\mathcal O_X\\)</span>-module), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]\">\\([X]\\)</span> (fundamental class), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_1(E)\">\\(c_1(E)\\)</span> (first Chern class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveCurve}_S,\\mathrm{Coh}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveCurve}_S,\\mathrm{Coh}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S,\\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S,\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S,\\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S,\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S\\)</span> (ambient predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S,\\mathrm{Slope}_S,\\mathrm{Stable}_{\\mu,S},\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S,\\mathrm{Slope}_S,\\mathrm{Stable}_{\\mu,S},\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}\\)</span> (slope predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}projective\\text{-}curve} \\vdash \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\tau_X=\\operatorname{Zar}(X)\\land\\operatorname{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\dim_{\\kappa(x)}(\\mathfrak m_x/\\mathfrak m_x^2)=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}projective\\text{-}curve} \\vdash \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\tau_X=\\operatorname{Zar}(X)\\land\\operatorname{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\dim_{\\kappa(x)}(\\mathfrak m_x/\\mathfrak m_x^2)=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}free\\text{-}coherent} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X,r)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,E)\\land r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\land E|_U\\cong_{\\mathcal O_X|_U}(\\mathcal O_X|_U)^r\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}free\\text{-}coherent} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X,r)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,E)\\land r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\land E|_U\\cong_{\\mathcal O_X|_U}(\\mathcal O_X|_U)^r\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}subsheaf} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S(F,\\iota,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,F)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,E)\\land\\iota:F\\Rightarrow_{\\mathcal O_X}E\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\forall a,b\\in F(U)\\;(\\iota_U(a)=\\iota_U(b)\\to a=b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}subsheaf} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S(F,\\iota,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,F)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,E)\\land\\iota:F\\Rightarrow_{\\mathcal O_X}E\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\forall a,b\\in F(U)\\;(\\iota_U(a)=\\iota_U(b)\\to a=b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S(d,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X,r)\\land\\operatorname{rk}(E)=r\\land d=\\langle c_1(E),[X]\\rangle\\in\\mathbb Z\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S(d,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X,r)\\land\\operatorname{rk}(E)=r\\land d=\\langle c_1(E),[X]\\rangle\\in\\mathbb Z\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{Slope}_S(q,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists d\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S(d,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land q=d/\\operatorname{rk}(E)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{Slope}_S(q,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists d\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S(d,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land q=d/\\operatorname{rk}(E)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists q_E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_E,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall F,\\iota\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S(F,\\iota,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(F)&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(E))\\to\\exists q_F\\;(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_F,F,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land q_F&lt;q_E)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists q_E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_E,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall F,\\iota\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S(F,\\iota,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(F)&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(E))\\to\\exists q_F\\;(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_F,F,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land q_F&lt;q_E)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists q_E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_E,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall F,\\iota\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S(F,\\iota,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(F)&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(E))\\to\\exists q_F\\;(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_F,F,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land q_F\\leq q_E)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slope} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists q_E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_E,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall F,\\iota\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S(F,\\iota,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(F)&lt;\\operatorname{rk}(E))\\to\\exists q_F\\;(\\mathrm{Slope}_S(q_F,F,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land q_F\\leq q_E)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The degree is the integer pairing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle c_1(E),[X]\\rangle\">\\(\\langle c_1(E),[X]\\rangle\\)</span>; the cohomology class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_1(E)\">\\(c_1(E)\\)</span> itself is not divided by the rank.</li>\n<li>Harder-Narasimhan: canonical filtration <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0 = E_0 \\subset \\cdots \\subset E_k = E\">\\(0 = E_0 \\subset \\cdots \\subset E_k = E\\)</span> with semistable quotients</li>\n<li>Over a smooth curve, every positive-rank coherent subsheaf of a locally free sheaf is torsion-free and hence locally free; the slope clause is therefore defined for every subsheaf tested.</li>\n<li>The monomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> is explicit, so “subsheaf” is not confused with literal inclusion of the sets coding two sheaves.</li>\n<li>Higgs bundles: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E, \\phi)\">\\((E, \\phi)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi: E \\to E \\otimes K\">\\(\\phi: E \\to E \\otimes K\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-stability uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg(E)\">\\(\\deg(E)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Moduli: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(r, d)\">\\(M(r, d)\\)</span> of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-semistable bundles; GIT quotient exists</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Seshadri, Quotient Spaces</li>\n<li>Huybrechts and Lehn, The Geometry of Moduli Spaces of Sheaves</li>\n<li>Simpson, Higgs Bundles and Local Systems</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-slope-—-Slope","text":"df-slope — Slope","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-projective-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"71c5426cce937ee1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-projective-curve.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"13f5e356bc6a9655","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-chern-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"8ee356c2b76fa7ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-chern-class.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_X=\\operatorname{Zar}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_X","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_X","display":false},{"tex":"[X]","display":false},{"tex":"c_1(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveCurve}_S,\\mathrm{Coh}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S,\\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S,\\mathrm{CoherentSubsheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BundleDegree}_S,\\mathrm{Slope}_S,\\mathrm{Stable}_{\\mu,S},\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mu,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}projective\\text{-}curve} \\vdash \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\tau_X=\\operatorname{Zar}(X)\\land\\operatorname{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\dim_{\\kappa(x)}(\\mathfrak m_x/\\mathfrak m_x^2)=1\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}free\\text{-}coherent} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocallyFreeCoherent}_S(E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X,r)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveCurve}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal O_X)\\land\\mathrm{Coh}_S(X,\\mathcal O_X,E)\\land r\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\land E|_U\\cong_{\\mathcal O_X|_U}(\\mathcal O_X|_U)^r\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}subsheaf} \\vdash \\mathrm{C